{"id":1030403,"chapter_id":1030403,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"玛莉·珍·凯莉？你是说凯莉吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"真是个叫人怀念的名字……她当时就喜欢坐在你这个座位上。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"时间尚早，屋子里没有什么客人。服务员擦着玻璃杯，有一句没一句地回答着你的问题。","style":3,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"凯莉她……是个可怜的女人。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"她原本是芭蕾舞团的明日之星。和每一个不幸的新城少女一样，被男人欺骗、怀孕、抛弃，理所当然地丢掉了自己的工作。最糟糕的时候，几乎就要流落街头。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"但她还是选择生下了那个孩子。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"服务员停下了手里的工作，看了一眼店门。","style":3,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"我还记得她第一次来我这里时的样子。外面在下雨，她没带伞，浑身湿透地闯进来，央求我给她一份工作。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"刚开始她只是在台上唱唱歌跳跳舞，后来有客人出价，她就陪他们坐坐，赚些零用钱。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"在我们这里讨生活不容易，凯莉的性格也……怎么说呢，比较执拗，过得不算好。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"直到那个男人找上了她。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"服务员啧了啧嘴，看得出来，他不太喜欢“那个男人”。","style":3,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"他叫威廉，一开始只是普通地来店里，没想到一来二去和凯莉对上了眼。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"威廉是幻影娱乐的业务经理，有钱，本身也是艺人出身，长相帅气，会哄女人开心。凯莉呢，她又是个恋爱脑，每次都会被男人哄得百依百顺，更别提是威廉这样的情场高手了。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"只可惜，威廉不喜欢凯莉的女儿。凯莉的女儿和她不一样，很聪明，也很有主见。有时候她们俩站在一起，会让人觉得凯莉才是该被照顾的那方。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"威廉和凯莉的女儿见过几次，看得出来他没什么好脸色。凯莉被夹在中间，非常辛苦。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"求婚那天威廉也提到了那个小姑娘，说可以把她送到贵族寄宿学校。凯莉听到的时候脸色可真是精彩。我们当时甚至偷偷开了个盘，赌凯莉会不会当场甩脸色走人。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"content":"说到这里，服务员笑着摇了摇头。","style":3,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"凯莉没有走，她直接给了那男人一巴掌。虽然嘴上不说，但她其实一直很爱自己的孩子。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"后来呢？","style":2,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"后来？","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"content":"服务员叹了口气。","style":3,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"后来的事情，我们就都有些看不明白了。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"凯莉第二天来店里上班的时候，我们问她女儿怎么说的。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"你知道她的反应是什么吗？她一脸迷茫地看着我们，说：“女儿？什么女儿？”","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"我们一开始都以为，她和女儿吵架了。那是常有的事。但自那以后，没人再从凯莉嘴里听到任何有关女儿的事。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"content":"她就这样和威廉结婚了？","style":2,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"没有没有。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"他们最后还是分手了。就在店里，就在求婚后的第二天晚上，狗血得像幻影娱乐拍的八点档肥皂剧。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"虽然嘴上不说，但凯莉最后还是选了自己的女儿。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"再后来，凯莉离开了我的店。也没有去别的我知道的地方，我们就这样失去了她的音讯。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"或许是那天的吵架让她醒悟了吧……我们这种工作终究没办法给女儿一个正常的童年。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"speaker":"贾维斯","content":"我很庆幸，她那样幼稚的家伙，在最后能做出一个正确的决定。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1042,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"content":"最后一个字播放完毕。阿黛拉的面色却依旧像一滩平静的死水。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"您告诉我这些，是想表达什么呢？","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"options":["你和你母亲或许有些误会"],"style":6,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403036,"trial_step":36,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你和你母亲或许有些误会","goto":37}]},{"step":37,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"误会？她走上通往幸福的道路。少一个累赘，即使不是和某人结婚，也一定能过上更安逸的生活。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"content":"……我知道，你们之间的确有着难以言喻的痛苦回忆，但也有同样无法割舍的羁绊。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"content":"你消除了她所有关于你的记忆，但她其实从一开始就没打算抛弃你。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"content":"她很在乎你，为了你愿意放弃唾手可得的“幸福”。她本该有机会弥补自己犯下的错误，也有权力带着这些痛苦的记忆继续走下去。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"content":"但你所做的，只是傲慢地替她选择，伤害了她，也伤害了自己。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"这对我没有意义。我早已不在乎这些了。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"content":"阿黛拉无比冷漠的声音打断了你。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"事到如今，即使翻看我过去的烦恼，也只像是别人的记忆。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"content":"漆黑尖锐的剪刀闪烁着危险的金属光泽，反射出阿黛拉陌生而阴沉的脸。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"content":"与之相对的，是在耳边响起的，极其轻柔的絮语。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"就这样……到此为止吧。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"您很善良，也很有毅力，总是试图“拯救”每一个人。但没关系，不用这么麻烦，即使您不干涉其中……我也有更快的解决方法。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"我会就此离开，继续过我的平静生活，不被任何人打扰，也不用回忆什么过去。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"你我都会忘记今天发生的一切，就当这一切都没有发生过……","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"content":"阿黛拉举起了剪刀，汹涌的狂厄力量汇聚于刀剑，猛地向你奔袭而来。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"content":"千钧一发之际，你对她使用了枷锁。持握剪刀的手悬停于半空。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403054,"trial_step":54},{"step":53,"content":"你不可能因为她的激烈反应就这样放弃。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403055,"trial_step":55},{"step":54,"content":"你总是在说，想要安宁，想要“平静的生活”。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403056,"trial_step":56},{"step":55,"content":"我想问你，究竟怎样才算是“平静的生活”呢？","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403057,"trial_step":57},{"step":56,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403058,"trial_step":58},{"step":57,"content":"阿黛拉没有回答。平静之下，隐藏着汹涌的暗潮。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403059,"trial_step":59},{"step":58,"content":"是抛弃每一段记忆，一次又一次地重新开始吗？","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403060,"trial_step":60},{"step":59,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"您觉得那样不是平静的生活吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403061,"trial_step":61},{"step":60,"content":"不，那样只是逃避。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403062,"trial_step":62},{"step":61,"content":"你竭尽全力动用枷锁的力量，压制着面前的禁闭者。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403063,"trial_step":63},{"step":62,"content":"你总是温柔地照顾每一个人的感受，与他们建立羁绊，再故作毫不留恋地抹除曾经相处的记忆……就像对待我……就像你曾对你的母亲做过的那样。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403064,"trial_step":64},{"step":63,"content":"那样……太残酷了……","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403065,"trial_step":65},{"step":64,"content":"枷锁的力量在你与阿黛拉的体内流转。一度被隐去的画面在脑海中闪现。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403066,"trial_step":66},{"step":65,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"……你已经是第二次倒在我面前了。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403068,"trial_step":68},{"step":66,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"……每次都把自己搞得这么狼狈，我得加班帮你收拾整齐了。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403069,"trial_step":69},{"step":67,"content":"是你救了我。","style":2,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403070,"trial_step":70},{"step":68,"content":"谢谢，给你添麻烦了。","style":2,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403071,"trial_step":71},{"step":69,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"没关系，我在家就是这样，能让你舒舒服服睡个好觉才是最重要的。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403072,"trial_step":72},{"step":70,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"现在你来到我的小店，便是我的“客人”了。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403073,"trial_step":73},{"step":71,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"那些是……什么……","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403074,"trial_step":74},{"step":72,"content":"突如其来的回忆剧烈地动摇了阿黛拉的情绪。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403075,"trial_step":75},{"step":73,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"放开我！","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403076,"trial_step":76},{"step":74,"content":"我不会放开的，阿黛拉，你不能再逃避了。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403077,"trial_step":77},{"step":75,"content":"总是在抛弃过去的人，要怎样才能拥有未来呢……","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403078,"trial_step":78},{"step":76,"content":"聊点什么吧，阿黛拉","style":2,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403080,"trial_step":80},{"step":77,"content":"像你一直做的那样。","style":2,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403081,"trial_step":81},{"step":78,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"你想聊什么呢？","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403082,"trial_step":82},{"step":79,"content":"什么都行。","style":2,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403083,"trial_step":83},{"step":80,"content":"只要是你想说的，我都会听。就像你曾经对我做的那样。","style":2,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403084,"trial_step":84},{"step":81,"content":"她笑了，沉吟片刻，她再次开口。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403085,"trial_step":85},{"step":82,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"……我没有特别想倾诉的，还是说些你想听的吧。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403086,"trial_step":86},{"step":83,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"——关于“疯剪子”的故事。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403087,"trial_step":87},{"step":84,"content":"她的手指从耳后划过，轻轻为你归拢发型。剪刀又回到那个暧昧的距离，一下，又一下，碎发飘动，但这次你没有颤抖。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403088,"trial_step":88},{"step":85,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"很久以前，有一个幸运的没有烦恼的少女。她过着平静的生活，喜欢这样的生活，她以为大家都跟她一样。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403089,"trial_step":89},{"step":86,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"但好像并非如此。生活对大家很不好，慢慢的，她爱的人身上长出了很长很长的头发。怎么也剪不断的头发，让人苦闷至极的头发。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403090,"trial_step":90},{"step":87,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"大家每天活在痛苦中，只能用怨言宣泄心中的不满。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403091,"trial_step":91},{"step":88,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"少女想要帮忙，她去倾听，去照顾，尽己所能。有时候一顿红茶能减轻一点点症状，有时候眼泪可以。但最终还是无济于事。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403092,"trial_step":92},{"step":89,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"终于，少女发现，她做不了什么。那是别人的烦恼，只要人还记得，就无法放下。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403093,"trial_step":93},{"step":90,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"少女就祈祷得到能帮人忘记的力量。于是，她得到了一把神奇的剪刀。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403094,"trial_step":94},{"step":91,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"一刀下去，烦恼的头发全部凝聚，再被斩断，彻底消失。她爱的人终于不再被怨恨纠缠，永远忘记让自己烦恼的事情，她们又找回了清爽的笑容。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403095,"trial_step":95},{"step":92,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"少女的愿望实现了，她感谢神奇的剪刀，并约定一起守护大家，直到永远。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403096,"trial_step":96},{"step":93,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"——这就是疯剪子的故事。所有人都得到幸福的结局。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403097,"trial_step":97},{"step":94,"content":"巨大的狂厄波动自阿黛拉的体内喷涌而出，代表着烦恼与忧愁的头发在她头上疯狂生长。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403099,"trial_step":99},{"step":95,"content":"你一刻也没有懈怠，枷锁的力量牢牢拥抱着濒临暴走的阿黛拉。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403100,"trial_step":100},{"step":96,"content":"每个人都渴望无法割舍的亲密关系，渴望无忧无虑的生活。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403101,"trial_step":101},{"step":97,"content":"可现实中，没有什么是完美的，大家只是习惯了同时接受生活带来的美好与负担。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403102,"trial_step":102},{"step":98,"content":"你不一样。你过去的记忆太沉重了，沉重到你不得不逃避……一次又一次地逃避，直到逃避成为了你唯一的生活方式。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403103,"trial_step":103},{"step":99,"content":"可一味的逃避，除了空虚，什么都不会给你留下。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403104,"trial_step":104},{"step":100,"content":"……我知道这样很冒昧，但请你……给你身边的人一个机会，给你自己的未来一个机会吧。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403105,"trial_step":105},{"step":101,"content":"再试一次，试试面对，试试和你在乎的人一起，重新开始生活……","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403106,"trial_step":106},{"step":102,"content":"你想把阿黛拉拉近自己身边，但剪刀带来强烈的错乱却让你没有这种力气。","style":3,"background":2079,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403108,"trial_step":108},{"step":103,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"没关系的，别为我烦恼，侦探先生，没人会受到伤害……","female_content":"没关系的，别为我烦恼，侦探小姐，没人会受到伤害……","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_54","vo_trial_30403_1_54f"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2079,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403109,"trial_step":109},{"step":104,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"我是剪断烦恼的理发师，我擅长处理这种事。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2079,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403110,"trial_step":110},{"step":105,"content":"无数枪口对准，阿黛拉轻轻松开你的手。","style":3,"background":2079,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403111,"trial_step":111},{"step":106,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"再见，${PlayerName}。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2079,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403112,"trial_step":112},{"step":107,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"阿黛拉也好，疯剪子也好……以后，你都不用再为我烦恼了。","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2079,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403113,"trial_step":113},{"step":108,"content":"随着清晨第一缕阳光降临，狂厄的力量终于与经久不消的雾一道，于空气中逐渐散去。","style":3,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403114,"trial_step":114},{"step":109,"content":"阿黛拉仿佛耗尽了所有的力量，身体倾倒了下去。","style":3,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403115,"trial_step":115},{"step":110,"options":["接住阿黛拉"],"style":6,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403116,"trial_step":116,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"接住阿黛拉","goto":117}]},{"step":111,"content":"你上前一步，抱住了阿黛拉。","style":3,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403117,"trial_step":117},{"step":112,"content":"斯洛恩街发生的一切，那曾经忘却的两天两夜，如今正清晰地印刻于你的脑海。","style":3,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403118,"trial_step":118},{"step":113,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"侦探先生……","female_content":"侦探小姐……","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_58","vo_trial_30403_1_58f"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403119,"trial_step":119},{"step":114,"content":"阿黛拉的声音有些虚弱，却不再冷漠。","style":3,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403120,"trial_step":120},{"step":115,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"你还是和那时候一样……","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403121,"trial_step":121},{"step":116,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"自顾自地闯进别人的生活，把一切都搅得一团糟……","voice":["vo_trial_30403_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403122,"trial_step":122},{"step":117,"options":["我只是做我该做的事情。"],"style":6,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130403123,"trial